-- TOC entry 44950 (class 0 OID 0)
-- Dependencies: 7517
-- Name: FUNCTION fn_accounting_close_windows_pending(p_union_id uuid, p_club_id uuid, p_period_start timestamp with time zone, p_period_end timestamp with time zone); Type: COMMENT; Schema: public; Owner: postgres
--

COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.fn_accounting_close_windows_pending(p_union_id uuid, p_club_id uuid, p_period_start timestamp with time zone, p_period_end timestamp with time zone) IS 'Chunked weekly close (20261003): proves the missing round-2 windows of a book whose round 2 has no receipt, or proves round 3''s windows and reads its certificates once (fn_settle_accounting_rakeback_advance) for a book whose round 3 has no receipt, and returns true (the attempt ends as a committed step); false when there was nothing to do or outside a chunked close attempt.';


