COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.fn_achievement_unlock_server(p_user_id uuid, p_achievement_id text, p_progress numeric, p_evidence jsonb) IS 'Records an achievement the server can prove (definitions.evidence) and, on the transition to unlocked, pays its reward_diamonds once through award_diamonds_v2(achievement, reference achievement:<id>:<user>). Owner-only: called by tr_hand_history_royal_flush_achievement and fn_achievement_record_login. Never pays a row unlocked before 2026-10-19 (no back-pay). Added 2026-10-19.';


