-- Name: FUNCTION fn_ca_deleted_account_leaves_every_club(p_user uuid); Type: COMMENT; Schema: public; Owner: postgres
--

COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.fn_ca_deleted_account_leaves_every_club(p_user uuid) IS 'Owner October 16: a deleted account leaves every club in the transaction that deletes it. Free club chips return to the main bank through fn_ca_deleted_wallet_bank_return; any other remaining custody refuses the deletion; downline and agent children move to the nearest live upline; agent rows are suspended; memberships depart with an audit_trail row. Idempotent. Service and trigger only.';


