--

COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.fn_ca_finished_not_completed_open_alert(p_tournament_id uuid) IS 'The open fn_ca_tournament_finished_but_not_completed alert that already names this tournament, or NULL. The detector raises only on NULL, so one open alert exists per stuck tournament and an alert about another tournament silences nothing (20260922160729).';


