COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.fn_ca_tournament_finished_but_not_completed(p_minutes integer) IS 'Tournaments still RUNNING with one player or fewer left, past the threshold. Every other payout check on this database judges COMPLETED tournaments only, so this class was invisible until 2026-09-07. One open alert per stuck tournament; an alert closes when every tournament it names has COMPLETED (20260922160729). Detector only - settles nothing.';


