COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.fn_lightning_operator_may(p_club_id uuid) IS 'Lightning Phase 12 (20261009144343): the operator gate - service_role (auth.role()), or a signed-in caller who is a platform admin (fn_is_platform_admin) or may review the club''s integrity (fn_ca_can_review_integrity: owner, co_owner or admin, not banned or suspended). service_role only; the operator doors call it as their owner.';


