COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.fn_profile_presence(p_user_ids uuid[]) IS 'Who of the accounts asked for is online now: is_online counted only while last_seen is under five minutes old (the friends list and ca_club_member_downline rule). Never returns last_seen, which is its owner''s. Ruling 25 (docs/DIAMOND-RULINGS.md), migrations 20260930234000 and 20260930234500.';


