COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.fn_project_stake_band(p_band text, p_available text[]) IS 'Project a merit band onto the bands that have a game. Downward only, never promotes, returns the band unchanged when p_available is empty or holds nothing at or below it. The SQL twin of effectiveStakeBandFor in HorseBehavior.ts - change one and change the other.';


