COMMENT ON COLUMN public.lightning_hand.request_id IS 'The p_request_id fn_lightning_form_hand was called with, unique across hands (lightning_hand_one_per_request), so a retried formation answers with the hand it already formed instead of forming a second one. NULL when the caller supplied none. Immutable from birth.';


