COMMENT ON TABLE public.lightning_hand_player IS 'One player''s participation in one Lightning hand, at one of that player''s tables. Keyed to the hand and to the player''s own pool slot by composite foreign keys, so a participation cannot name another player''s table, a hand in another cluster, or an epoch its hand did not run in. The formation barrier itself - at least two players, no seat past the instance''s max_size - is a statement about the whole set and belongs to the formation function of spec Phase 9.';


