COMMENT ON VIEW public.v_tournament_rake_attribution_gaps IS 'Settled CHIP rake that reached nobody. Before 2026-08-31 this shape was invisible: fn_settle_tournament_rake stamped attributed_at whenever attribution returned ok, including when it credited zero players, so the repair sweep (which selects attributed_at IS NULL) could never see it. Since 2026-10-17 a Diamond Arena fee (destination diamond_house) is left out: it pays the Diamond house and owes no VIP points, chip rakeback or commission, so crediting nobody is its designed outcome.';


