--
-- TOC entry 54505 (class 0 OID 0)
-- Dependencies: 26510
-- Name: CONSTRAINT chip_ledger_a_union_wallet_side_names_its_column ON chip_ledger; Type: COMMENT; Schema: public; Owner: postgres
--

COMMENT ON CONSTRAINT chip_ledger_a_union_wallet_side_names_its_column ON public.chip_ledger IS 'A union_wallets row holds six balances, so a union_wallet side of a leg names the one that moved (from_label / to_label), unless the other side names a promo bank or the leg is a journal-only correction. Without it the ledger replay cannot key the leg: 1,489,358.47 of rake payments read as kill-switch drift on 2026-10-04. NOT VALID: legs written before 2026-10-04 are kept as they are.';


